# TypeScript

- Never use `any` — prefer `unknown` + narrowing
- Prefer inferred types; add explicit return types on public APIs
- Use discriminated unions for complex state
- Zod for runtime validation (`features/*/validations/` or colocated); `react-hook-form` + `@hookform/resolvers/zod` for forms
- Fix type errors before committing (run `pnpm typecheck` as part of `/check-and-commit`, not after every edit)
